Your dad was way cheekier than you when he was young.

26
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:33,580
Once he took my Diabolo...

27
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:42,000
[Saint Qiao High School]

28
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:45,000
[Xinjian High School]

29
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:48,000
[Judges]

30
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:50,000
[Chengnan High School]

31
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:52,000
[Jianghai High School]

32
00:03:58,120 --> 00:03:59,550
Everyone, please settle down.

33
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:00,540
I'm the host of this Tournament.

34
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:01,980
First of all, on behalf of the Tournament Committee,

35
00:04:02,920 --> 00:04:04,860
I'd like to extend to all the Teams participating

36
00:04:05,320 --> 00:04:07,740
in the 1st Blazing Teens Yo-Yo
Tournament held by Jianghai City

37
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:09,180
a warm welcome.

38
00:04:25,960 --> 00:04:27,390
Also present today...

39
00:04:27,400 --> 00:04:29,310
are our Senior Judges from the Yo-Yo Community,

40
00:04:29,320 --> 00:04:30,750
from both inside and outside the Country!

41
00:04:31,320 --> 00:04:32,670
They will use their Professional Expertise

42
00:04:33,060 --> 00:04:34,110
to score our participating Teams.

43
00:04:35,080 --> 00:04:36,060
Behind them are some of

44
00:04:36,520 --> 00:04:37,980
the Parents of our competing Team Members.

45
00:04:38,440 --> 00:04:39,240
They will be here to

46
00:04:39,400 --> 00:04:41,340
cheer on all our competing Team Members.

47
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:42,780
Let's give them

48
00:04:42,940 --> 00:04:44,700
an equally warm round of applause for being here today!

49
00:04:52,640 --> 00:04:54,300
Now, before the Official Competition begins,

50
00:04:54,460 --> 00:04:55,740
I'd like to say a few words.

51
00:04:56,280 --> 00:04:57,180
As everyone knows,

52
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:59,580
the Yo-Yo originated in China.

53
00:05:00,040 --> 00:05:01,980
Around the year 1700,

54
00:05:02,440 --> 00:05:05,340
the Yo-Yo spread eastward from China to Nagasaki, Japan,

55
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:06,780
Westward to India,

56
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:08,700
and from India to Europe,

57
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:11,070
eventually sweeping across the World.

58
00:05:11,080 --> 00:05:13,020
On April 12, 1985,

59
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:15,900
as part of the Toys in Space project,

60
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:18,300
the Yo-Yo was taken into space for the first time

61
00:05:18,760 --> 00:05:20,670
by the Space Shuttle Discovery from NASA.

62
00:05:21,060 --> 00:05:22,110
Now, around the world,

63
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:25,020
The Yo-Yo Community continues to grow.

64
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:28,350
New techniques and new styles are emerging endlessly.

65
00:05:28,540 --> 00:05:29,790
Competitions at all levels

66
00:05:30,260 --> 00:05:32,700
are intense and spectacular.

67
00:05:33,640 --> 00:05:35,070
This Tournament, hosted by Jianghai City,

68
00:05:35,080 --> 00:05:37,470
is the first large-scale Yo-Yo Competition

69
00:05:37,480 --> 00:05:39,420
featuring Teams organized by various Wchools.

70
00:05:39,880 --> 00:05:40,860
It's a massive event!

71
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:43,230
The goal is to use the Yo-Yo,

72
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:45,180
a healthy and meaningful sport,

73
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:50,940
to improve our Students' coordination between
their minds, brains, hands, eyes, and bodies.

74
00:05:51,400 --> 00:05:54,300
It aims to develop Students' creativity and hands-on ability,

75
00:05:54,760 --> 00:05:56,220
and cultivate a persevering spirit.

76
00:05:57,160 --> 00:05:58,590
So our slogan is:

77
00:05:58,600 --> 00:06:00,060
"Study hard, play brilliantly."

78
00:06:00,520 --> 00:06:02,940
"Strive to be a blazing, youthful, determined teen."

79
00:06:03,400 --> 00:06:09,630
Blazing Teens, Blazing Yo-Yo.

80
00:06:09,640 --> 00:06:12,060
Blazing Teens, Blazing Yo-Yo.

81
00:06:17,320 --> 00:06:23,550
Blazing Teens, Blazing Yo-Yo.

82
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:25,500
Blazing Teens, Blazing Yo-Yo.

83
00:06:40,440 --> 00:06:43,230
After the Preliminary Selection
by the Tournament Committee,

84
00:06:44,200 --> 00:06:46,590
out of dozens of School Teams across the City,

85
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:49,020
we have selected the 4 most outstanding School Teams.

86
00:06:49,180 --> 00:06:50,460
to join us in this

87
00:06:50,620 --> 00:06:53,340
Blazing Teens Yo-Yo Tournament. They are:

88
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:55,740
The Chengnan Team,

89
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:04,380
The Xinjian Team,

90
00:07:08,280 --> 00:07:10,140
The Jianghai Team,

91
00:07:16,640 --> 00:07:18,780
and The Saint Qiao Team.

92
00:07:27,880 --> 00:07:29,820
It looks like the Players from the 4 Competing Teams

93
00:07:30,280 --> 00:07:31,740
are fully prepared.

94
00:07:32,200 --> 00:07:33,660
They are full of energy and high morale!

95
00:07:34,200 --> 00:07:36,540
I believe this Blazing Teens Yo-Yo Tournament

96
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:39,900
will be extremely exciting, intense, and spectacular.

97
00:07:40,160 --> 00:07:41,340
Now, I'll announce

98
00:07:41,600 --> 00:07:43,260
the Schedule and Rules of the Competition.

99
00:07:44,200 --> 00:07:46,140
The Tournament will take place over 2 days.

100
00:07:46,200 --> 00:07:48,540
Day 1 will be the Group Championship Matches.

101
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:49,980
The Competition uses a Points System.

102
00:07:50,440 --> 00:07:51,870
Players from each Team will take the Stage

103
00:07:51,880 --> 00:07:53,820
to perform their chosen Yo-Yo tricks.

104
00:07:54,460 --> 00:07:56,220
The Judges will then score their Performances.

105
00:07:56,680 --> 00:07:58,140
The Scores of all Players on
a Team will be added together

106
00:07:58,600 --> 00:07:59,580
to produce a final total score.

107
00:08:00,520 --> 00:08:03,420
The Team with the highest total score
will be crowned the Group Champion,

108
00:08:03,880 --> 00:08:05,820
and awarded the title of 'Blazing Team!'

109
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:16,860
[Blazing Team Trophy]

110
00:08:20,760 --> 00:08:21,660
On the second day,

111
00:08:22,120 --> 00:08:23,100
we will hold the Individual Competition.

112
00:08:23,560 --> 00:08:24,540
From the first day's Group Matches,

113
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:26,460
the Top 10 highest-scoring Individual Players

114
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:28,380
will compete for the Individual Championship!

115
00:08:29,120 --> 00:08:30,300
The Individual Champion will be awarded

116
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:32,700
the glorious title of 'Blazing Teen!'

117
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:53,000
[Blazing Teen Trophy]

118
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:57,180
You came.

119
00:08:58,600 --> 00:08:59,580
How are you? All good?

120
00:09:00,040 --> 00:09:01,500
I'm fine. Being with them,

121
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:03,900
