122
00:09:05,800 --> 00:09:08,700
Then this time our Team will give it everything we've got.

123
00:09:09,640 --> 00:09:10,620
Awesome.

124
00:09:11,080 --> 00:09:13,020
This way, all our hard work won't go to waste.

125
00:09:26,340 --> 00:09:26,940
Just let him be.

126
00:09:33,160 --> 00:09:35,100
Alright, I now announce:

127
00:09:36,040 --> 00:09:39,900
Jianghai City's 1st Blazing Teens Yo-Yo Tournament

128
00:09:40,360 --> 00:09:41,820
Officially begins!

129
00:10:09,640 --> 00:10:11,980
Coach, looks like we're in for a fierce Battle today.

130
00:10:14,920 --> 00:10:15,900
Worried?

131
00:10:19,040 --> 00:10:22,140
No, I believe the Jianghai Team can hold their ground.

132
00:10:24,220 --> 00:10:26,460
Leo, you're in Command today.

133
00:10:26,920 --> 00:10:27,900
Give it everything you've got.

134
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:30,780
Your Grandpa is watching you.

135
00:10:33,620 --> 00:10:34,320
Coach.

136
00:10:34,580 --> 00:10:36,340
I won't let you or Jianghai High School down.

137
00:10:37,660 --> 00:10:38,940
Neither will we.

138
00:10:41,020 --> 00:10:42,300
According to the pre-draw,

139
00:10:42,660 --> 00:10:44,220
