140
00:10:44,580 --> 00:10:45,690
Hugo from the Chengnan Team!

141
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:47,580
Please welcome him.

142
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:51,420
Trust me.

143
00:10:52,360 --> 00:10:58,140
Go, Hugo!

144
00:11:56,680 --> 00:11:59,070
That was Hugo from the Chengnan Team...

145
00:11:59,080 --> 00:12:01,020
