146
00:12:01,100 --> 00:12:03,420
And he received a High Score of 9.96!

147
00:12:03,880 --> 00:12:05,340
Next up is...

148
00:12:05,800 --> 00:12:06,780
Gordon from the Saint Qiao Team!

149
00:13:30,760 --> 00:13:32,700
He scored 9.97!

150
00:13:33,340 --> 00:13:34,140
Go, Saint Qiao Team!

151
00:13:35,080 --> 00:13:36,060
Saint Qiao Team, Champions!

152
00:13:36,500 --> 00:13:40,860
Wow, Hot Dog really looks like
he's giving it his all today.

153
00:13:42,600 --> 00:13:43,260
Stay cool.

154
00:13:47,560 --> 00:13:48,990
Next, we invite

155
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:51,420
Jianghai Team's Shawn to the Stage.

156
00:13:53,320 --> 00:13:54,300
It's my turn already?

157
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:57,660
Shawn, don't forget what I taught you before.

158
00:13:59,260 --> 00:14:01,020
Why can't I remember anything?

159
00:14:01,960 --> 00:14:02,610
Shawn, stay calm!

160
00:14:03,580 --> 00:14:04,190
Just do what you normally do.

161
00:14:05,800 --> 00:14:07,260
Right, you need to start us off strong.

162
00:14:07,720 --> 00:14:10,140
A strong start? My heart's pounding now.

163
00:14:10,600 --> 00:14:12,540
Squirrel, you're so useless!

164
00:14:13,480 --> 00:14:13,980
Mickey.

165
00:14:14,520 --> 00:14:15,720
Shawn, it's up to you.

166
00:14:17,320 --> 00:14:18,270
Shawn.

167
00:14:18,280 --> 00:14:19,260
Don't let all our hard work and sweat...

168
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:21,240
