169
00:14:25,280 --> 00:14:26,460
Then I'll go all out!

170
00:14:40,920 --> 00:14:44,220
Jianghai Team, Victory!

171
00:15:49,080 --> 00:15:51,420
Steal the Sky and Swap the Sun!

172
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:53,000
Yeah!

173
00:16:21,720 --> 00:16:23,100
Just now, Jianghai Team Member

174
00:16:23,840 --> 00:16:26,460
Shawn's score is 9.94.

175
00:16:27,400 --> 00:16:30,170
Ah, what a pity. The score is too low.

176
00:16:31,240 --> 00:16:32,190
Don't blame yourself.

177
00:16:32,200 --> 00:16:33,660
You've already given the Jianghai Team a great start.

178
00:16:34,120 --> 00:16:35,100
Yeah, Shawn.

179
00:16:35,560 --> 00:16:37,050
Your progress has been lightning fast.

180
00:16:38,900 --> 00:16:39,900
Squirrel.

181
00:16:40,450 --> 00:16:42,300
You're already a Professional Yo-Yo Player.

182
00:16:42,840 --> 00:16:44,200
Yeah, I barely recognize you.

183
00:16:45,060 --> 00:16:46,620
Really? Thank you, thank you.

184
00:16:46,880 --> 00:16:48,540
I'm so excited! Thank you, everyone.

185
00:16:49,280 --> 00:16:50,460
If I asked you for an autograph,

186
00:16:50,920 --> 00:16:51,900
you wouldn't refuse, right?

187
00:16:52,440 --> 00:16:54,510
I never thought of that.

188
00:16:56,200 --> 00:16:57,660
Alright, Chuck, stop teasing him.

189
00:16:58,780 --> 00:17:00,040
Shawn, you did well.

190
00:17:01,660 --> 00:17:02,460
Thanks, Coach.

191
00:17:02,920 --> 00:17:03,900
Next up is

192
00:17:04,360 --> 00:17:05,340
Xinjian Team's Felix.

193
00:17:11,560 --> 00:17:13,020
Go, Xinjian Team!

194
00:17:13,480 --> 00:17:14,460
Xinjian Team, Undefeated!

195
00:18:29,120 --> 00:18:31,740
What? No way!

196
00:18:32,380 --> 00:18:35,100
Just 0.01 away from a perfect score.

197
00:18:36,040 --> 00:18:37,980
Everyone, just now Xinjian Team's Felix

198
00:18:38,140 --> 00:18:40,110
actually got a high score of 9.99.

199
00:18:41,120 --> 00:18:42,300
That's very impressive.

200
00:18:42,460 --> 00:18:45,180
This Score is currently the Highest

201
00:18:45,640 --> 00:18:46,620
among the 4 Competing Teams.

202
00:18:47,080 --> 00:18:49,020
Congratulations to the Xinjian Team.

203
00:18:58,600 --> 00:19:01,020
I didn't know the Xinjian Team was this strong.

204
00:19:01,960 --> 00:19:02,940
According to reliable sources,

205
00:19:03,400 --> 00:19:04,860
Felix is the Captain of the Xinjian Team.

206
00:19:05,320 --> 00:19:06,280
No wonder his skills are superb.

207
00:19:07,220 --> 00:19:09,660
Each one better than the last...
What do we do then?

208
00:19:11,260 --> 00:19:13,020
Team Competition depends on overall performance.

209
00:19:13,280 --> 00:19:14,940
One person alone can't win it.

210
00:19:15,400 --> 00:19:17,910
Right, don't worry. The Competition has just begun.

211
00:19:19,240 --> 00:19:20,700
Everyone, concentrate and perform at your best.

212
00:19:23,560 --> 00:19:24,250
The Competition continues.

213
00:19:25,280 --> 00:19:28,380
The next Competitor is Jianghai Team's Mark.

214
00:19:31,240 --> 00:19:33,660
Go, Mark!

215
00:20:31,240 --> 00:20:33,150
Jianghai Team's current score

216
00:20:33,340 --> 00:20:35,100
is 19.92 points.

217
00:21:00,520 --> 00:21:02,460
Saint Qiao Team's current score

218
00:21:03,880 --> 00:21:05,410
